@* jquery-validation + unobtrusive, bundled by webpack (app/js/bundles/page-validation.ts). Needs jQuery already loaded
   by the page's own bundles, so this must come after them. The validation plugin attaches to window.jQuery, which is
   whichever copy was loaded last, so no other jQuery script may be loaded after this one. *@
<script src="~/js/page-validation.min.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
